# Ignore everything at the repository root by default.
# Only the files/folders explicitly allowed below will be tracked.
#
# This repository should contain ONLY the CoC Attack Tracker files.
# Everything else (other projects in the workspace, temp files, caches, etc.)
# must not be accidentally staged or committed.

# Root-level: ignore all non-dotfile entries.
/*

# Allow the CoC Attack Tracker root files.
!.env.example
!VERCEL_DEPLOY_NOTES.md
!app.py
!vercel.json
!static/
!templates/
!.gitignore

# Inside templates/: allow only base.html, ignore the rest.
# (capital.html, index.html, members.html, wars.html are other-project templates.)
templates/*
!templates/base.html

# (static/ is fully allowed: css/ and js/ and all their contents.)
